Maybe the rule involves comparing shapes across blocks: the output cell could be "color that appears in this position's shape elsewhere"? Let me look at patterns: block(i,j) has color v, shape S_ij (mask). Perhaps output[i][j] = v if shape matches some reference, else another color. Out values include colors not equal to block color frequently.

